SUMMARY:Final Fantasy XIV Event Calendar · FFVII Remake crossover · Keyb
 ound Brawler
DESCRIPTION:Play the typing challenge to earn points for the Guard Scorpio
 n mount (430 points)\, Avalanche outfits\, and the Barret minion. Reach le
 vel 15 and complete It Could Happen to You. A physical keyboard is require
 d. Earn and spend event points before the crossover closes.\n\nBefore Vers
 ion 8.0 maintenance\n\nSource: https://actff1.web.sdo.com/project/20261014
 keybound_brawler/o48khqshmn6e/index.html
