 nd Metian Attire. Reach level 50 and finish The Ultimate Weapon\, then spe
 ak to the Neophyte Adventurer in Ul’dah’s Steps of Nald. Seasonal Even
 t Replay grants no repeat rewards.\n\nSource: https://actff1.web.sdo.com/p
 roject/20261029ffxvi/uvjx9y9g2k2p/index.html
